======================================================================
FINAL POSITION
======================================================================

We accept Outcome-Informed Remediation Assurance Triage as the first decision product.

We accept document-internal alignment as the first analytical experiment.

We do not accept document-internal alignment alone as the complete high-value product.

The first usable product should combine:

- Remediation mechanism alignment
- Collective action-set coverage
- Scope alignment
- Implementation and verification evidence
- Temporal consistency
- Pre-closure and post-closure event retrieval

The output remains an evidence-graded independent-review candidate, not a conclusion that remediation succeeded or failed.

If Tier 2 cannot be validated, deploy only a clearly labelled Remediation Documentation Alignment Review, provided it still changes decisions or materially reduces review effort.

Please now convert the accepted proposition into the final executable analytical specification without broadening it back into an enterprise platform.
